; BIND Zone File for consiguetuvisa.com
; Importable into Cloudflare DNS (DNS -> Records -> Import DNS Records)
$ORIGIN consiguetuvisa.com.
$TTL 3600

; Apex domain (consiguetuvisa.com) pointing to Vercel
@ IN A 76.76.21.21

; Subdomain (www.consiguetuvisa.com) pointing to Vercel
www IN CNAME cname.vercel-dns.com.
